ad of many separate calls.\n- Be concise in your responses\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files\n</rules>","skills":"<skills>\nThe following skills provide specialized instructions for specific tasks.\nUse the read tool to load a skill's file when the task matches its description.\nResolve relative paths against the skill's directory (parent of SKILL.md). Use absolute paths in tool calls.\n\n<available_skills>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:972e83f667423584a2e2]</name>\n    <description>松涛16配送方式报价规则</description>\n    <location>[path:e61ebb292572ab2a84d5]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:b491e1d72c0c17efa793]</name>\n    <description>松涛19外发报表个人信息处理</description>\n    <location>[path:712b96d6e0a5ccb07623]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:81a3d06a38fd3d36870a]</name>\n    <description>松涛19交易金额对账</description>\n    <location>[path:e4f98ff607f2a1994da9]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:9a2ea50ae31385b4bcfd]</name>\n    <description>松涛74包裹运输路由规则</description>\n    <location>[path:35cd72eeb1dedb2917f3]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:657aae94010b165a1daa]</name>\n    <description>松涛29发票含税金额计算</description>\n    <location>[path:386804c3d43464daa8e2]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:54dc3f7745cf4a16cf50]</name>\n    <description>松涛29按行计算税额</description>\n    <location>[path:98fa50acaa505038a496]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:73bf67177bc0a2d77721]</name>\n    <description>松涛60退货审批政策</description>\n    <location>[path:1649c972436a7da840bc]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:4c9a897af2c0905fe20e]</name>\n    <description>松涛54包裹运输路由规则</description>\n    <location>[path:2e05fbca49168b34d999]</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>[identifier-word:3eb10529669ffc88c3c4]</name>\n    <description>松涛15区域资助资格政策</description>\n    <location>[path:79e9ed0260